# Deny by default: every change needs @hanthor's review, because master is
# pulled and applied (with sudo) by every fleet machine's daily timer.
# Branch protection requires code-owner review, so agent and bot PRs that
# touch these paths wait for a human; everything carved out below can
# auto-merge once CI is green. Direct pushes by the owner are unaffected.
* @hanthor

# ── Carve-outs: nothing here runs on fleet machines ─────────────────────
/docs/
*.md
/tests/
# Cluster manifests are applied by hand, never by the fleet timer.
/talos-k8s/
# pi agent skills are prompt text, not executed config.
/roles/pi/files/skills/
# Dependency bumps. package.json is additionally guarded by CI
# (deps-guard): versions may change, the dependency set may not.
/roles/pi/files/package.json
/tools/secret-broker/go.mod
/tools/secret-broker/go.sum
/aws/.terraform.lock.hcl

# ── Always owned, even inside carve-outs ────────────────────────────────
/.github/ @hanthor
